path	src/lexsi_unlearn/scrub.py	/Users/	scrubber regex that detects home paths, not a real path
path	src/lexsi_unlearn/scrub.py	/home/	scrubber regex that detects home paths, not a real path
ip	src/lexsi_unlearn/scrub.py	8\.8\.8\.8	public DNS in the scrubber allowlist, not a private host
